WEBVTT

00:06:55.385 --> 00:07:00.427
or mythologizing myself to you.

00:07:00.427 --> 00:07:05.805
Somehow, through some miraculous

00:07:05.805 --> 00:07:10.305
synaptic function of the human brain,

00:07:10.305 --> 00:07:15.761
it's impossible to stutter when you sing.

00:07:15.761 --> 00:07:19.517
And when I was younger,
that was a method of treatment

00:07:19.517 --> 00:07:21.970
that worked very well for me,

00:07:21.970 --> 00:07:27.850
singing, so I did it a lot.

00:07:27.850 --> 00:07:31.993
And that's why I'm here today.